# Default exclusions, which keep the build context for Dockerfile.release
# small. The dev images opt out of all of these via their own
# Dockerfile.dev.dockerignore / Dockerfile.dev.arm64.dockerignore files:
# BuildKit uses <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to this file.
.git
bazel-*
user.bazelrc
experiments
Dockerfile*
# Prebuilt proxy binary at the repo root (not part of the source tree).
proxy
